WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.526 --> 01:01.906
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 24]

01:34.800 --> 01:36.240
You are saying this

01:37.039 --> 01:39.080
as if I compete with His Majesty.

01:40.599 --> 01:44.080
That's not up to you.

01:50.360 --> 01:50.879
Mr. Fan...

01:50.879 --> 01:52.058
Enough said.

01:52.078 --> 01:53.757
You sent me off
outside of the Capital just now.

01:53.759 --> 01:56.279
I don't want to get
any more sentimental.

02:05.480 --> 02:07.520
Be nice to Wan'er.

02:19.510 --> 02:22.380
I will take full responsibility
for the actions of the Imperial Guards.

02:22.559 --> 02:24.699
What have you got to do
with the Imperial Guards training?

02:24.719 --> 02:25.799
Training?

02:26.640 --> 02:28.099
I have just realized

02:28.119 --> 02:30.699
that the Imperial Guards
have lacked training in recent years.

02:30.719 --> 02:32.659
They aren't well-prepared for warfare.

02:32.679 --> 02:33.419
We left the Capital

02:33.439 --> 02:35.060
for training.

02:35.080 --> 02:38.160
A harsh journey trains the toughest soldiers,
do you know that?

02:38.279 --> 02:39.219
Thank you.

02:39.239 --> 02:40.379
What for?

02:40.399 --> 02:41.380
I'm training my soldiers.

02:41.400 --> 02:43.239
Does that concern you, Inspector Fan?

03:06.239 --> 03:07.300
Why are you here, Chengru?

03:07.320 --> 03:08.799
We ran into each other.

03:08.959 --> 03:10.419
What has happened?

03:10.439 --> 03:11.880
Is my father...

03:12.880 --> 03:13.890
A little trouble.

03:13.910 --> 03:16.099
It's not a little trouble
if the Black Cavalries show up.

03:16.119 --> 03:18.720
Luckily, his identity as the inspector
is quite useful.

03:19.880 --> 03:21.140
It's all right now?

03:21.160 --> 03:23.091
I should thank you for assisting me,
Your Highness.

03:23.111 --> 03:23.831
No need to thank me.

03:23.831 --> 03:25.710
The Black Cavalries wouldn't retreat
in front of the Imperial Guards.

03:25.710 --> 03:27.959
Only you could resolve
the confrontation just now.

03:29.160 --> 03:30.259
Thank you, Chengru.

03:30.279 --> 03:32.239
We are siblings. Don't say that.

03:36.080 --> 03:39.079
There is no need for courtesy
between us.

03:39.320 --> 03:41.160
Still, you saved my father's life.

03:41.360 --> 03:42.440
Fan Xian,

03:42.880 --> 03:44.479
I owe you my life.

03:46.480 --> 03:48.399
Husband and wife should be one.

03:48.399 --> 03:50.959
Your life is mine too.

03:52.679 --> 03:54.020
We haven't got married yet.

03:54.040 --> 03:54.959
We haven't got married yet?

03:54.959 --> 03:56.639
Are you trying to deny it?

04:07.399 --> 04:08.300
His Majesty

04:08.320 --> 04:11.199
summons the First Prince and Fan Xian.

04:15.960 --> 04:17.179
That's quick.

04:17.199 --> 04:18.960
Push all the blame onto me
if Father gets angry.

04:18.960 --> 04:20.280
Tell him it was my idea
to send Prime Minister Lin off.

04:20.280 --> 04:20.870
No.

04:20.890 --> 04:22.730
You can't handle the consequence
of defying the decree.

04:22.730 --> 04:24.900
His Majesty instructed Prime Minister Lin
to retire and return to his hometown.

04:24.900 --> 04:26.680
This is the decree I heard of.

04:28.999 --> 04:31.079
Send Dabao back when he wakes up.

04:31.920 --> 04:33.759
Don't worry. It will be all right.

04:35.759 --> 04:37.320
I will go to the palace with you.

04:39.840 --> 04:41.360
It would be done for, then.

05:07.800 --> 05:09.959
I will show you the way.

05:10.199 --> 05:11.639
Where will Father meet us?

05:11.679 --> 05:12.959
In the Imperial Study.

05:13.400 --> 05:14.480
Please.

05:16.840 --> 05:17.840
If it were a serious charge,

05:17.860 --> 05:19.700
the Ministry of Justice would show up
to arrest you.

05:19.720 --> 05:20.500
It's no big deal

05:20.520 --> 05:21.880
if it's not the main hall.

05:26.239 --> 05:27.320
Eunuch Hong.

05:28.720 --> 05:29.880
May I eat this?

05:30.199 --> 05:31.320
Hold.

05:35.759 --> 05:37.120
You look relaxed.

05:37.199 --> 05:38.619
If His Majesty executes me,

05:38.639 --> 05:40.279
I don't want to be a hungry ghost.

05:40.350 --> 05:41.480
Do you want some?

05:42.870 --> 05:44.419
If we would end up being ghosts,

05:44.439 --> 05:45.839
I would be the hungry one.

05:46.030 --> 05:48.150
Think about
what you are going to answer later.

05:49.199 --> 05:50.279
No worries.

05:50.319 --> 05:52.320
I have already died once.

06:02.439 --> 06:03.519
What's wrong?

06:03.559 --> 06:04.619
Maybe his foot is sprained.

06:04.639 --> 06:05.659
It's fine. Go without me.

06:05.679 --> 06:06.800
I will treat him.

06:12.400 --> 06:13.619
After His Majesty learned the news,

06:13.639 --> 06:15.140
he didn't show much emotion.

06:15.160 --> 06:17.320
However, His Majesty
ate a few pieces of pastry

06:17.360 --> 06:19.159
from the Imperial Kitchen.

06:20.040 --> 06:21.979
Normally, His Majesty
wouldn't eat pastries

06:21.999 --> 06:23.920
when he gets angry.

06:24.199 --> 06:25.519
You are brave.

06:25.540 --> 06:26.979
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

06:26.999 --> 06:27.739
I won't forget

06:27.759 --> 06:29.440
your kindness, Mr. Fan.

06:35.559 --> 06:36.639
Your Majesty,

06:36.999 --> 06:39.040
they are waiting for your summon.

06:40.600 --> 06:41.900
Bring the First Prince.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.150
Yes, Your Majesty.

06:53.840 --> 06:56.800
Your Highness,
His Majesty summons you in.

07:12.079 --> 07:12.979
Father.

07:12.999 --> 07:16.399
I heard you have had frequent contact
with Fan Xian lately.

07:18.800 --> 07:20.159
Yes.

07:23.239 --> 07:24.880
Did you come here

07:24.920 --> 07:28.639
to make a plea for him

07:28.960 --> 07:31.279
or for yourself?

07:31.639 --> 07:34.387
I want to make a plea for both of us.

07:34.407 --> 07:36.247
Why do you want to plead for him?

07:37.319 --> 07:39.719
He is to my liking.

07:42.679 --> 07:45.360
To your liking?

07:45.920 --> 07:47.000
Come.

07:47.239 --> 07:48.319
Sit here.

07:49.639 --> 07:50.719
Sit.

07:57.360 --> 08:01.079
Why is he to your liking?

08:01.860 --> 08:02.980
He

08:03.199 --> 08:04.340
values affections.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.520
He values affections.

08:05.520 --> 08:06.800
What about others?

08:07.639 --> 08:10.120
Officials in the Capital value vanity.

08:10.280 --> 08:11.800
Only a few value affections.

08:14.759 --> 08:15.920
Your Majesty,

08:16.520 --> 08:19.060
Minister of Revenue, Fan Jian,
requests an audience.

08:19.080 --> 08:20.299
Tell him to wait outside.

08:20.319 --> 08:21.520
Yes, Your Majesty.

08:22.999 --> 08:27.040
You said only a few people
value affections.

08:27.239 --> 08:28.880
Do you know why?

08:30.319 --> 08:31.480
I don't know, Father.

08:34.479 --> 08:35.760
Li Chengru,

08:36.120 --> 08:38.719
you are a man of loyalty and honesty.

08:39.599 --> 08:41.800
It's better you don't know about that.

08:44.839 --> 08:46.539
I was stationed at the border for years.

08:46.559 --> 08:48.500
I'm far from being insightful.

08:48.520 --> 08:49.800
That's better.

08:50.319 --> 08:52.079
You won't have many concerns, then.

08:55.120 --> 08:56.200
Off you go.

09:00.079 --> 09:01.159
Yes, Father.

09:05.479 --> 09:08.199
Bring the Fans in.

09:09.920 --> 09:11.079
Yes, Your Majesty.

09:47.319 --> 09:48.479
Mr. Chen,

09:48.679 --> 09:50.160
can I stop now?

09:50.280 --> 09:51.520
Keep on.

09:58.599 --> 10:01.560
We have been waiting for ages, Mr. Chen.

10:06.040 --> 10:07.120
Your Majesty,

10:07.439 --> 10:09.400
I came here to accept punishment.

10:09.920 --> 10:11.400
What have you done wrong?

10:14.160 --> 10:17.110
I left the Capital and deployed
the Black Cavalries without permission.

10:18.040 --> 10:19.199
Your Majesty,

10:19.520 --> 10:21.260
before Prime Minster Lin left,

10:21.280 --> 10:24.980
he gave me the list
of his disciples and acquaintances.

10:25.000 --> 10:27.079
I present this to you, Your Majesty.

10:36.640 --> 10:37.720
Fan Jian,

10:38.040 --> 10:39.479
what did you come here for?

10:40.320 --> 10:41.220
Well...

10:41.240 --> 10:42.359
I...

10:45.120 --> 10:48.199
What is that inside your sleeve?

10:54.599 --> 10:55.760
A ferule.

10:55.780 --> 10:56.559
Why did you bring this?

10:56.559 --> 10:58.550
Fan Xian defied your order.

10:58.570 --> 11:01.059
He left the Capital and deployed
the Black Cavalries without permission.

11:01.079 --> 11:02.860
I was livid when I heard about it.

11:02.880 --> 11:04.980
The Fan family has always
served the monarch loyally.

11:05.000 --> 11:07.140
I didn't expect him to be so rebellious.

11:07.160 --> 11:08.939
How are you going to deal with him?

11:08.959 --> 11:10.160
I will

11:10.719 --> 11:12.100
flog him.

11:12.120 --> 11:13.200
Go ahead.

11:14.599 --> 11:15.679
Flog him.

11:19.160 --> 11:20.560
You rebellious brat!

11:21.079 --> 11:21.980
How dare you!

11:22.000 --> 11:23.140
You are so infuriating!

11:23.160 --> 11:24.100
You!

11:24.120 --> 11:26.079
I'm going to beat you to death.

11:26.839 --> 11:29.160
I swear I will!

11:31.400 --> 11:32.500
You rebellious brat!

11:32.520 --> 11:33.640
Fan Jian.

11:34.280 --> 11:35.659
If I don't beat you to death,

11:35.679 --> 11:37.319
I'm too shameful to face His Majesty.

11:37.320 --> 11:38.440
You!

11:38.760 --> 11:41.839
Enough, drop the act already.

11:50.816 --> 11:52.239
Urgh, Mr. Chen.

11:54.675 --> 11:57.820
[The conversation is calming down,
Fan Xian is safe]

12:01.120 --> 12:02.440
That's enough.

12:04.280 --> 12:05.760
Fan Xian is safe now.

12:06.640 --> 12:08.160
He's safe now.

12:09.800 --> 12:10.959
Really?

12:17.559 --> 12:19.559
Why have you been showing
a straight face?

12:19.559 --> 12:22.119
You scared me.

12:23.000 --> 12:24.440
Heed my advice.

12:30.640 --> 12:32.520
Don't be too clever.

12:34.400 --> 12:35.760
I will keep that in mind.

12:36.559 --> 12:37.532
If so,

12:37.552 --> 12:40.273
I will return and wait for Mr. Fan.

12:40.719 --> 12:42.079
Since you are here,

12:42.559 --> 12:44.020
do me a favor.

12:44.040 --> 12:45.120
Sure, please.

12:48.800 --> 12:51.780
[The Sixth Division spy was found dead
30 li south of the Capital this morning]

12:51.800 --> 12:53.560
The Sixth Division member was killed?

12:53.679 --> 12:54.860
Would you mind to go there?

12:54.880 --> 12:56.520
I wouldn't mind, of course.

12:56.540 --> 12:58.459
But judging from the distance
of this place to the Capital,

12:58.479 --> 12:59.680
this area

12:59.800 --> 13:02.260
should be handled
by the local authority.

13:02.280 --> 13:03.360
Yes.

13:03.800 --> 13:06.040
But we are understaffed now.

13:06.040 --> 13:07.000
You are experienced in this.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.359
Help me take a look.

13:09.079 --> 13:11.040
Is there anything special
about this case?

13:12.439 --> 13:14.560
I wait for you to tell me that.

13:15.479 --> 13:16.560
I will set off now.

13:16.640 --> 13:17.959
Use the south gate.

13:18.719 --> 13:20.476
Someone will meet you at Liujia Slope.

13:20.496 --> 13:22.040
I will get back to you soon.

13:33.479 --> 13:34.819
Prime Minister Lin

13:34.839 --> 13:37.599
is not my concern at all.

13:38.959 --> 13:40.659
I summon you two here

13:40.679 --> 13:43.320
for another matter.

13:43.959 --> 13:45.039
Fan Xian,

13:45.559 --> 13:46.959
it's time for your wedding.

13:47.160 --> 13:48.059
Pardon?

13:48.079 --> 13:51.440
It's time for your wedding, Fan Xian.

13:53.240 --> 13:54.879
The wedding of me and Wan'er?

13:55.120 --> 13:57.339
Do you want to marry another woman?

13:57.359 --> 13:59.079
No! I want only Wan'er.

13:59.400 --> 14:00.480
Fine.

14:01.079 --> 14:03.640
The wedding will be in three days.

14:03.800 --> 14:04.999
Three days?

14:05.079 --> 14:06.959
Will that be enough?

14:07.599 --> 14:10.079
Allocate the money
from the Ministry of Rites first.

14:10.559 --> 14:13.800
As for the rest,
we will compensate them later.

14:13.806 --> 14:16.380
Your Majesty, it isn't appropriate.

14:16.400 --> 14:17.719
Fan Jian, Fan Xian,

14:18.479 --> 14:19.740
listen up.

14:19.760 --> 14:21.100
This wedding

14:21.120 --> 14:22.980
isn't for your family.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.400
It's for the state.

14:26.199 --> 14:27.020
Indeed.

14:27.040 --> 14:28.440
You are wise, Your Majesty.

14:28.559 --> 14:30.119
As you command.

14:33.120 --> 14:34.440
Get up.

14:41.780 --> 14:42.359
How was it?

14:42.359 --> 14:43.140
Is everything all right?

14:43.140 --> 14:43.920
I'm getting married!

14:43.920 --> 14:45.199
- Mr. Fan!
- Remember to attend my wedding.

14:45.199 --> 14:46.050
You are getting married?

14:46.050 --> 14:47.879
Mr. Fan!

14:48.199 --> 14:50.280
Mr. Fan!

14:52.000 --> 14:53.860
He's getting married soon!

14:53.880 --> 14:56.520
I'm heading to announce the decree.

14:57.920 --> 14:59.220
Have you announced the decree?

14:59.240 --> 15:00.320
Yes.

15:00.640 --> 15:02.059
Do you want to stay for tea?

15:02.079 --> 15:03.680
I need to hurry back to the palace.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.999
The wedding is three days later?

15:09.040 --> 15:11.040
We don't have much time to prepare.

15:11.640 --> 15:12.900
It's manageable.

15:12.920 --> 15:14.299
It's handled by the Ministry of Rites

15:14.319 --> 15:15.720
and funded by the palace.

15:16.479 --> 15:17.459
I told you so.

15:17.479 --> 15:18.659
His Majesty greatly favors Xian

15:18.679 --> 15:20.400
for his talent.

15:23.520 --> 15:25.699
You accepted the decree so impatiently?

15:25.719 --> 15:26.879
Don't worry.

15:27.359 --> 15:29.719
You need to be steady.

15:36.479 --> 15:38.380
Why is the fuss?

15:38.400 --> 15:39.539
Father, Mother,

15:39.559 --> 15:40.179
Xian,

15:40.199 --> 15:41.279
Ruoruo.

15:41.599 --> 15:42.980
We are going to be rich.

15:43.000 --> 15:44.532
This is a venture with zero capital.

15:44.552 --> 15:45.592
What zero capital?

15:45.599 --> 15:46.959
It sounds like a robbery.

15:47.199 --> 15:48.160
Oh, come on.

15:48.160 --> 15:49.479
Don't say that.

15:49.760 --> 15:51.000
Your wedding

15:51.020 --> 15:53.220
is a way more lucrative business
than robbery.

15:53.240 --> 15:54.679
What nonsense is this?

15:54.679 --> 15:55.740
Think about this.

15:55.760 --> 15:56.970
Funded by the palace

15:56.990 --> 15:58.620
and organized by the Ministry of Rites,

15:58.640 --> 16:00.939
we don't have to spend a dime.

16:00.959 --> 16:02.100
Such tremendous imperial grace.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.800
This is a great honor.

16:04.959 --> 16:06.179
Fair enough.

16:06.199 --> 16:07.279
I know, right?

16:07.439 --> 16:08.659
When the day comes,

16:08.679 --> 16:11.419
all dignitaries and officials
in the Capital

16:11.439 --> 16:13.300
will be desperate to attend.

16:13.320 --> 16:15.220
Are you suggesting
we receive a great deal of cash gift

16:15.240 --> 16:16.599
from the big turnout?

16:17.000 --> 16:19.400
I'm afraid not.

16:19.520 --> 16:21.079
He probably wants otherwise.

16:21.839 --> 16:23.920
As expected of my brother.

16:24.079 --> 16:26.239
Won't the cash gift be less
with a small turnout?

16:26.280 --> 16:27.860
Why bother

16:27.880 --> 16:28.920
about that mere cash gift?

16:28.920 --> 16:29.900
That's not important.

16:29.920 --> 16:31.079
The cash gift isn't important?

16:31.080 --> 16:32.539
Qualification is the one
that matters here.

16:32.559 --> 16:33.459
What qualification?

16:33.479 --> 16:34.950
To attend the wedding.

16:34.970 --> 16:36.819
Who wouldn't want
to attend this wedding, right?

16:36.839 --> 16:38.939
We must have a grand wedding

16:38.959 --> 16:40.059
as much as we can

16:40.079 --> 16:41.980
and spread the news
as far as Northern Qi.

16:42.000 --> 16:42.860
However,

16:42.880 --> 16:44.659
the chance to enter the Fan's Residence

16:44.679 --> 16:46.140
for the wedding

16:46.160 --> 16:47.140
must be as limited

16:47.160 --> 16:48.260
and selective as possible.

16:48.280 --> 16:51.280
Those dignitaries in the Capital
would feel ashamed to show their faces

16:51.280 --> 16:53.160
if they can't attend.

16:54.400 --> 16:56.320
Hunger marketing, huh?

16:56.880 --> 16:57.599
Well,

16:57.599 --> 16:59.240
we can let our guests starve, right?

16:59.240 --> 17:01.290
We must provide them
with good food and drink.

17:02.640 --> 17:03.859
Isn't that an offensive decision

17:03.879 --> 17:05.439
on choosing the guests?

17:05.839 --> 17:07.040
Not at all.

17:07.246 --> 17:08.579
We will open the seats for sale.

17:08.599 --> 17:09.460
It's fair and just.

17:09.480 --> 17:10.919
The higher bidders win.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.299
It's the term Xian invented,

17:12.319 --> 17:12.980
auction.

17:13.000 --> 17:13.859
Our sister-in-law

17:13.879 --> 17:15.899
is the royal princess,
a prestigious status.

17:15.919 --> 17:16.940
If she gets married,

17:16.960 --> 17:18.500
her brothers will come, right?

17:18.520 --> 17:19.319
The Crown Prince,

17:19.319 --> 17:20.379
other princes,

17:20.399 --> 17:21.819
and all court officials will also come.

17:21.839 --> 17:23.379
I can't imagine how high
the price can be.

17:23.399 --> 17:24.859
Everyone might just
lose their rationale.

17:24.879 --> 17:26.980
I must host this auction.

17:27.000 --> 17:28.480
I will control the pace.

17:29.000 --> 17:30.260
You returned here secretly.

17:30.280 --> 17:31.720
You better lie low.

17:32.839 --> 17:33.450
It doesn't matter.

17:33.450 --> 17:35.690
Given how competitive the auction would be,
it doesn't matter who leads the action.

17:35.690 --> 17:36.500
Ruoruo, you can lead it.

17:36.520 --> 17:37.600
Right?

17:38.240 --> 17:40.660
When all these people come,

17:40.680 --> 17:41.879
we will...

17:42.639 --> 17:43.420
Xian,

17:43.440 --> 17:44.825
you might need

17:44.845 --> 17:46.885
to marry a few more.

17:47.040 --> 17:48.619
Once the business model is formed,

17:48.639 --> 17:50.660
we will surely become the richest
in the Qing State.

17:50.680 --> 17:52.460
I marry only Wan'er in this life.

17:52.480 --> 17:53.679
No more.

18:00.280 --> 18:01.360
Fine.

18:01.800 --> 18:02.660
One is fine.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.840
No problem.

18:03.860 --> 18:05.830
I can still establish
this business model.

18:06.119 --> 18:09.660
Do you mean you will do this
at your own wedding too?

18:09.680 --> 18:10.240
Oh, no.

18:10.240 --> 18:11.210
No one would attend my wedding.

18:11.210 --> 18:12.839
The groom can only be Fan Xian.

18:14.079 --> 18:15.399
How about this?

18:15.599 --> 18:17.359
It might be inconvenient for Wan'er.

18:17.919 --> 18:19.059
A few years later,

18:19.079 --> 18:20.240
find an excuse

18:20.319 --> 18:21.720
to divorce her.

18:22.720 --> 18:23.660
After that,

18:23.680 --> 18:24.859
you will reconcile.

18:24.879 --> 18:26.850
So when you get married again,

18:26.870 --> 18:28.780
we can hold another wedding
and take the cash gift again.

18:28.800 --> 18:29.819
Marry then divorce.

18:29.839 --> 18:30.619
Repeat this process

18:30.639 --> 18:31.720
over and over again,

18:31.720 --> 18:33.020
and we are going to be rich!

18:33.040 --> 18:34.159
We will be rich...

18:41.879 --> 18:42.959
Sit down.

19:02.639 --> 19:03.719
Take this.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.320
Look at this.

19:13.680 --> 19:14.870
Have some water.

19:18.119 --> 19:19.200
Drink some.

19:21.919 --> 19:23.560
Here. Please drink some tea.

19:33.839 --> 19:35.079
Have some water.

19:41.639 --> 19:42.980
Send these over there.

19:43.000 --> 19:44.080
Yes.

19:44.800 --> 19:46.030
I have some here too.

19:46.480 --> 19:47.560
Give them to me.

19:53.319 --> 19:54.339
Where is he going?

19:54.359 --> 19:55.439
To the loo.

19:56.200 --> 19:57.940
Why is he bringing
a book and a brush along?

19:57.960 --> 19:59.020
They are granted permission

19:59.040 --> 20:00.180
to use the latrine,

20:00.200 --> 20:01.720
but they can't slack off.

20:09.879 --> 20:11.000
Ginseng soup.

20:17.910 --> 20:19.320
Where is Her Highness?

20:34.639 --> 20:35.879
I'm done here.

20:37.800 --> 20:39.879
Take the fainted one away.

20:43.599 --> 20:44.940
Give him a flatbread.

20:44.960 --> 20:46.339
Add some chili powder.

20:46.359 --> 20:47.839
Let him rest.

20:47.919 --> 20:49.539
Bring a flatbread here.

20:49.559 --> 20:50.679
Hurry.

20:52.480 --> 20:53.560
Eat this.

20:56.040 --> 20:57.200
Your Highness.

20:57.720 --> 20:58.919
You are here.

21:00.319 --> 21:04.240
Mr. Yuan, how are you settling
in Xinyang?

21:04.390 --> 21:05.879
Everything is all right.

21:06.079 --> 21:09.359
It's just that the food
is a bit spicy for me.

21:09.480 --> 21:11.960
Doesn't the Prime Minister's Residence
serve spicy food?

21:12.119 --> 21:15.480
They follow Prime Minister Lin's taste.

21:15.559 --> 21:18.200
It has been tough on you

21:18.399 --> 21:19.899
hiding here for years.

21:19.919 --> 21:23.520
Fortunately,
I didn't let down your mission

21:23.919 --> 21:26.839
to drag Lin Ruofu down.

21:34.839 --> 21:36.660
Whether or not he holds the position

21:36.680 --> 21:38.280
has nothing to do with me.

21:38.599 --> 21:40.359
After all, this show

21:41.399 --> 21:43.200
is staged by you-know-who.

21:43.879 --> 21:46.359
We are just playing along.

21:46.559 --> 21:49.159
You should know that, right?

21:49.599 --> 21:50.679
Yes, I do,

21:51.879 --> 21:54.280
but I have to pretend not to.

21:56.079 --> 21:58.079
Good liars delude themselves.

21:59.639 --> 22:00.760
Brilliant.

22:00.919 --> 22:02.480
You flatter me.

22:05.200 --> 22:07.320
By the way, you don't eat spicy food,
do you?

22:08.839 --> 22:09.919
Come here.

22:12.000 --> 22:14.099
Behead the chefs
in Mr. Yuan's residence.

22:14.119 --> 22:15.439
Replace a new batch.

22:21.079 --> 22:22.159
Your Highness,

22:22.359 --> 22:24.000
there is no need for that.

22:24.639 --> 22:26.200
I'm getting used to the food.

22:26.559 --> 22:29.560
Maybe I will grow fond of spicy food
a few days after.

22:31.000 --> 22:33.740
Your only weakness is kindness.

22:33.760 --> 22:36.059
I have gotten used to it.

22:36.079 --> 22:37.839
Nice guys finish last.

22:38.720 --> 22:40.599
I'm the best example.

22:42.399 --> 22:42.839
Otherwise,

22:42.839 --> 22:45.599
I wouldn't be driven to this place
from the Capital.

22:50.800 --> 22:53.800
Are these flowers vibrant to look at?

22:54.480 --> 22:55.960
Why are you doing this?

22:56.320 --> 22:57.960
Wan'er is getting married soon.

22:58.159 --> 22:59.480
I'm preparing a gift.

22:59.720 --> 23:01.220
Precious jewels or pearls

23:01.240 --> 23:02.879
are not elegant enough.

23:04.399 --> 23:06.280
I prefer something beautiful.

23:07.680 --> 23:10.399
This place looks rather barren
after the flowers are trimmed.

23:13.359 --> 23:14.339
By next year,

23:14.359 --> 23:16.320
the flowers will grow brilliantly again.

23:16.559 --> 23:18.280
The roots are injured.

23:19.280 --> 23:20.960
I need to prepare some fertilizer.

23:22.520 --> 23:23.560
Kindness has become you.

23:23.580 --> 23:25.720
You live up to your reputation,
Your Highness.

23:29.119 --> 23:30.420
It's only right

23:30.440 --> 23:31.839
for one to be so.

23:34.663 --> 23:36.079
Who are these people?

23:37.240 --> 23:39.839
The best accountants
from all the shops in Xinyang

23:39.839 --> 23:41.030
are gathered here.

23:41.050 --> 23:42.359
To work on the ledger?

23:42.919 --> 23:44.439
After the wedding,

23:45.210 --> 23:46.760
Fan Xian will take over
the Imperial Treasury.

23:46.760 --> 23:48.119
[Imperial Treasury Ledger No. 73]

23:48.119 --> 23:50.639
I have all the accounts sorted

23:51.559 --> 23:53.359
as a wedding gift for him.

23:59.159 --> 24:01.539
Don't need to hold back
if you have something to tell.

24:01.559 --> 24:04.359
The Imperial Treasury ledger
is supposed to be confidential.

24:04.720 --> 24:07.639
These accountants must be warned

24:08.000 --> 24:09.839
not to leak anything out.

24:10.200 --> 24:12.679
Didn't I tell you
I need to prepare fertilizer?

24:25.200 --> 24:26.720
By next year,

24:28.200 --> 24:29.960
this place will be in full bloom again.

24:57.480 --> 24:58.599
Gentlemen.

25:00.559 --> 25:01.639
Gentlemen.

25:05.639 --> 25:06.440
What took you so long?

25:06.440 --> 25:07.960
I have been here for a while.

25:11.000 --> 25:12.119
Wait.

25:12.359 --> 25:13.410
What are they doing?

25:13.430 --> 25:14.760
They are setting defense.

25:17.440 --> 25:20.160
The deceased inside is
a skilled fighter of the Sixth Division.

25:20.200 --> 25:21.720
We will guard the place here.

25:22.119 --> 25:23.760
You go inside to examine the body.

25:24.319 --> 25:26.560
Shouldn't you call for a coroner?

25:26.680 --> 25:28.139
This is confidential.

25:28.159 --> 25:30.000
The fewer people who know, the better.

25:32.726 --> 25:35.919
I can't do this without the instrument.

25:53.879 --> 25:55.520
Come in with me.

26:08.159 --> 26:09.660
If you notice any sinister movement,

26:09.680 --> 26:11.439
kill at will!

26:11.639 --> 26:13.420
If half of our men die,

26:13.440 --> 26:15.079
spread force to defend

26:15.240 --> 26:17.679
and escort Wang Qinian
back to the Capital.

26:37.639 --> 26:39.599
These are the top-notch pieces.

26:40.480 --> 26:42.639
I expected more.

26:42.800 --> 26:44.320
You seem to have taken

26:44.480 --> 26:46.420
Fan Xian's wedding too seriously.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.720
Your Highness,

26:47.760 --> 26:49.480
Miss Ye wants to see you.

26:52.079 --> 26:53.159
Show her in.

27:01.319 --> 27:02.679
You came at this hour.

27:04.359 --> 27:05.370
What are you up to?

27:05.390 --> 27:07.520
Wan'er and Fan Xian
are getting married soon.

27:07.599 --> 27:08.720
I know.

27:08.839 --> 27:10.599
Wan'er is like my sister.

27:11.079 --> 27:13.119
She went through a lot
to be with Fan Xian.

27:13.520 --> 27:14.720
Don't make trouble.

27:18.599 --> 27:19.819
What makes you think that way?

27:19.839 --> 27:21.059
Why do you think?

27:21.079 --> 27:22.850
It's true that I set Fan Xian up before.

27:22.870 --> 27:24.260
But it's different this time.

27:24.280 --> 27:25.660
I don't want any trouble

27:25.680 --> 27:27.240
to mess up my own sister's wedding.

27:29.200 --> 27:30.280
Look.

27:31.520 --> 27:33.839
I'm choosing their wedding gift.

27:33.919 --> 27:35.240
Give me a hand.

27:42.919 --> 27:44.119
Do you swear?

27:47.680 --> 27:49.299
How about we make a deal?

27:49.319 --> 27:50.220
What deal?

27:50.240 --> 27:51.760
You ask me a question.

27:52.040 --> 27:53.410
I swear to Heaven

27:53.430 --> 27:54.940
that I will answer you honestly.

27:54.960 --> 27:57.539
Otherwise, I will end pathetically

27:57.559 --> 27:59.520
in the dirt.

28:00.159 --> 28:01.599
But on one condition.

28:01.639 --> 28:02.500
What condition?

28:02.520 --> 28:04.180
I will ask you a question too.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.700
You must be honest.

28:05.720 --> 28:06.960
This is only fair.

28:07.559 --> 28:08.460
Deal.

28:08.480 --> 28:09.440
I don't lie anyway.

28:09.440 --> 28:10.520
You have to swear.

28:11.919 --> 28:14.280
All right. I swear to Heaven

28:14.319 --> 28:15.859
that I will answer

28:15.879 --> 28:17.339
whatever you are going to ask honestly.

28:17.359 --> 28:18.639
Failing that,

28:22.240 --> 28:24.439
the Ye family will be torn apart.

28:26.399 --> 28:27.479
Ask away.

28:28.280 --> 28:29.579
Will you cause trouble

28:29.599 --> 28:31.020
at Wan'er's wedding?

28:31.040 --> 28:31.680
I won't.

28:31.700 --> 28:32.680
Never even considered that?

28:32.680 --> 28:33.879
Never.

28:34.680 --> 28:36.899
No matter how terrible it is
between Fan Xian and I have become,

28:36.919 --> 28:39.919
I always see Wan'er as my little sister.

28:42.480 --> 28:43.599
Good, then.

28:43.760 --> 28:44.879
Your turn now.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.800
Just now, you said

28:51.720 --> 28:53.240
Wan'er and you

28:53.720 --> 28:55.180
are like sisters.

28:55.200 --> 28:56.819
More than just sisters.

28:56.839 --> 28:58.700
If so, you shouldn't keep anything
from her.

28:58.720 --> 29:00.119
That's not even possible.

29:00.119 --> 29:01.460
Which begs the question,

29:01.480 --> 29:02.639
what did Fan Xian tell you

29:02.639 --> 29:03.760
when he came

29:03.760 --> 29:05.599
on the day Lin Gong was killed?

29:07.960 --> 29:09.520
You swore on your family.

29:10.119 --> 29:11.639
Be honest.

29:13.159 --> 29:14.460
How did you know that?

29:14.480 --> 29:16.139
Fan Xian is a household name
in the Capital.

29:16.159 --> 29:17.899
Where he went and whom he met

29:17.919 --> 29:19.960
can be easily figured out
with little effort.

29:26.399 --> 29:27.299
Why?

29:27.319 --> 29:28.980
Is there a dark secret between you two

29:29.000 --> 29:31.780
that Wan'er doesn't know?

29:31.800 --> 29:32.500
No.

29:32.520 --> 29:33.679
So?

29:34.280 --> 29:36.000
Fan Xian came

29:37.040 --> 29:39.420
to ask me something.

29:39.440 --> 29:40.839
What did he ask?

29:43.079 --> 29:44.639
You witnessed Lin Gong

29:44.639 --> 29:47.520
meeting the two female assassins
from the Niulan Street assassination.

29:50.879 --> 29:53.599
You told Fan Xian about that.

29:58.079 --> 29:59.560
You promised

29:59.879 --> 30:01.339
you wouldn't mess up their wedding.

30:01.359 --> 30:03.560
Of course, I would keep my word.

30:03.839 --> 30:04.960
Don't worry.

30:05.112 --> 30:06.432
The wedding

30:06.680 --> 30:08.399
will be great fun.

30:13.079 --> 30:14.159
Mr. Chen.

30:14.919 --> 30:16.000
You are back.

30:31.839 --> 30:32.859
Good work.

30:32.879 --> 30:34.059
It's my duty.

30:34.079 --> 30:35.220
It's still bearable.

30:35.240 --> 30:36.899
Did you examine the body?

30:36.919 --> 30:37.999
Yes.

30:41.319 --> 30:41.899
How did he die?

30:41.919 --> 30:43.800
Killed by a sharp weapon.

30:44.240 --> 30:45.420
Judging from the wound,

30:45.440 --> 30:47.339
it was an extremely quick thrust

30:47.359 --> 30:48.319
beyond what a man can do.

30:48.319 --> 30:49.780
This person must be
exceptionally skilled.

30:49.780 --> 30:50.859
Aside from that,

30:50.879 --> 30:52.599
nothing much is worth mentioning.

30:53.839 --> 30:56.960
From Jiangnan to the Capital

30:58.119 --> 31:00.280
is a long journey.

31:01.000 --> 31:03.260
How does Jiangnan relate to this?

31:03.280 --> 31:04.800
A few days earlier,

31:05.000 --> 31:08.180
a serial killer appeared in Jiangnan.

31:08.200 --> 31:10.020
This person is highly skilled

31:10.040 --> 31:11.800
and untraceable.

31:12.440 --> 31:14.159
Fei Jie went there

31:14.159 --> 31:15.960
for this case.

31:16.919 --> 31:18.339
In that case,

31:18.359 --> 31:19.700
there is nothing to be worried about.

31:19.720 --> 31:24.379
Fei Jie just sent a pigeon back,
saying that he lost track.

31:24.399 --> 31:25.899
Even Elder Fei missed it?

31:25.919 --> 31:27.439
Starting from that day,

31:28.200 --> 31:29.560
from Jiangnan

31:29.800 --> 31:31.320
to the Capital,

31:31.839 --> 31:34.180
multiple of our peers were found dead

31:34.200 --> 31:37.020
along the governmental road
within a few days.

31:37.040 --> 31:38.599
Is the murderer

31:38.800 --> 31:42.180
coming after the Capital?

31:42.200 --> 31:44.679
The deceased you examined

31:45.559 --> 31:47.299
should be the last.

31:47.319 --> 31:48.559
At this rate.

31:48.560 --> 31:50.760
This person should arrive
in the Capital by now.

31:52.159 --> 31:53.520
But who could it be

31:53.879 --> 31:56.040
to get away with Elder Fei?

32:01.075 --> 32:03.170
[Imperial Inspectorate
Autopsy Report No. 125]

32:14.879 --> 32:16.760
This wound

32:17.000 --> 32:20.079
is exactly the same as
what I saw on the body earlier today.

32:22.919 --> 32:24.200
Done by the same person?

32:24.599 --> 32:25.919
Turn to the front pages.

32:26.280 --> 32:27.520
Go to the front pages

32:28.000 --> 32:29.580
and see the identity of the deceased.

32:29.600 --> 32:33.295
[Lin Gong]

32:44.680 --> 32:45.760
Mr. Chen,

32:46.207 --> 32:48.166
may I tell Mr. Fan

32:48.325 --> 32:50.420
about this?

32:50.440 --> 32:53.119
Why do you think I tasked you with this?

32:54.480 --> 32:55.560
Understood.

32:57.599 --> 32:58.800
I will take my leave.

33:05.319 --> 33:06.579
When Lin Gong was killed,

33:06.599 --> 33:08.260
Fan Xian was the suspect.

33:08.280 --> 33:09.980
But he argued

33:10.000 --> 33:12.500
that he didn't know Lin Gong
was involved in the assassination

33:12.520 --> 33:14.639
and claimed he had no reason
to kill him.

33:14.680 --> 33:15.480
But the fact is,

33:15.480 --> 33:16.879
he did know.

33:17.480 --> 33:18.919
He had a convincing motive.

33:19.399 --> 33:21.760
Ling Gong's death is very likely
related to him.

33:23.879 --> 33:25.000
Your Highness,

33:25.399 --> 33:26.440
did you accept the engagement

33:26.440 --> 33:28.099
and approach Miss Ye

33:28.119 --> 33:31.399
to find out the answer?

33:34.480 --> 33:36.520
Don't think too badly of me.

33:40.599 --> 33:42.079
Fan Xian marrying Princess Lin

33:42.079 --> 33:44.470
is the condition for taking over
the Imperial Treasury.

33:45.520 --> 33:47.399
Without this wedding,

33:47.960 --> 33:50.130
the Imperial Treasury might return
to its previous owner.

33:50.150 --> 33:51.139
Your Highness,

33:51.159 --> 33:52.539
three days are enough.

33:52.559 --> 33:54.379
As long as we tell Princess Lin
about this,

33:54.399 --> 33:57.180
this wedding will never happen.

33:57.200 --> 33:58.439
Xie Bi'an,

33:59.480 --> 34:02.599
I didn't expect such a vicious idea
from you.

34:09.160 --> 34:10.899
Are you saying
that there is a serial killer

34:10.919 --> 34:12.680
killing along the way
from Jiangnan to the Capital?

34:12.680 --> 34:13.760
Yes.

34:14.160 --> 34:15.899
Judging from the wound,

34:15.919 --> 34:18.220
it's similar to an autopsy report
from before?

34:18.240 --> 34:19.339
Exactly.

34:19.359 --> 34:21.819
Who is the deceased

34:21.839 --> 34:23.240
in the said autopsy report?

34:24.680 --> 34:26.120
Lin Gong.

34:39.560 --> 34:40.419
Are you sure?

34:40.439 --> 34:41.999
Certainly, Mr. Fan.

34:42.039 --> 34:44.760
The wounds on the two bodies
are very similar.

34:45.080 --> 34:46.140
The murderer

34:46.160 --> 34:47.519
killed the two people

34:47.600 --> 34:49.379
with an extremely quick thrust.

34:49.399 --> 34:50.919
It's beyond what a man can do.

34:52.200 --> 34:53.280
Of course,

34:53.440 --> 34:54.899
this also suggests another possibility.

34:54.919 --> 34:57.140
That is, the serial killer in question

34:57.160 --> 34:59.780
used a weapon similar to the one used

34:59.800 --> 35:01.220
by the murderer who killed Lin Gong,

35:01.240 --> 35:03.720
and both of them
have equally strong skills.

35:03.959 --> 35:06.399
That would also lead to this outcome.

35:09.039 --> 35:10.439
You said

35:12.120 --> 35:13.339
the murderer

35:13.359 --> 35:15.859
kills all the way to the Capital
from Jiangnan?

35:15.879 --> 35:17.720
At this pace,

35:17.999 --> 35:20.919
this person should be in the Capital
right now.

35:56.919 --> 35:58.600
For as long as I can remember,

35:58.760 --> 36:00.479
you have been protecting me.

36:00.879 --> 36:02.339
As long as with you around,

36:02.359 --> 36:03.919
I fear nothing.

36:04.359 --> 36:06.959
Not only are my guardian,

36:06.990 --> 36:08.819
but you're also
the most important family member to me

36:08.839 --> 36:10.359
in this world.

36:10.879 --> 36:12.320
So I hope

36:13.039 --> 36:14.819
[Fan's Residence]
you can find your own pursuit.

36:14.839 --> 36:16.999
Find my own pursuit?

36:17.800 --> 36:19.320
For myself?

36:38.800 --> 36:39.880
Who's there?

37:39.640 --> 37:41.080
Mr. Wuzhu,

37:42.280 --> 37:44.200
where exactly are you?

38:01.203 --> 38:03.123
Xian, you are awake.

38:03.200 --> 38:05.200
Madam Liu, Xian's up.

38:06.999 --> 38:08.060
Fan Xian, you are up.

38:08.080 --> 38:09.519
You slept well, didn't you?

38:09.959 --> 38:11.399
You are here, Madam Liu.

38:14.600 --> 38:16.039
Ruoruo, go out first.

38:16.879 --> 38:17.879
I need to get changed, Madam Liu.

38:17.879 --> 38:18.819
No need.

38:18.839 --> 38:20.399
You can try on these gowns.

38:25.280 --> 38:26.620
From those two boxes?

38:26.640 --> 38:27.780
Naive.

38:27.800 --> 38:29.320
There are more outside.

38:46.879 --> 38:49.160
This one. Let me try on that color.

38:54.839 --> 38:56.580
That. And that.

38:56.600 --> 38:57.959
Bring me that piece.

39:03.319 --> 39:05.339
You like him very much.

39:05.359 --> 39:07.260
You smile so happily.

39:07.280 --> 39:08.439
It's not that.

39:08.640 --> 39:09.959
I was thinking

39:10.120 --> 39:13.200
that Fan Xian should be trying on gowns
at this moment too.

39:13.240 --> 39:14.640
Of course he is.

39:15.879 --> 39:17.419
Do you think he would run away?

39:17.439 --> 39:18.800
From what?

39:18.839 --> 39:20.120
The wedding, of course.

39:23.400 --> 39:24.740
I think that looks quite suitable.

39:24.760 --> 39:26.260
What you think doesn't matter.

39:26.280 --> 39:27.999
You have to try on every piece.

39:29.479 --> 39:31.240
You go ahead and try. I'm off.

39:34.359 --> 39:36.299
Don't even think of leaving.

39:36.319 --> 39:37.160
This is too much trouble.

39:37.160 --> 39:38.839
I can't stand this.

39:38.959 --> 39:39.859
Trouble?

39:39.879 --> 39:41.060
This is only the innermost piece.

39:41.080 --> 39:42.560
There are three more sets
of undergarments.

39:42.560 --> 39:43.819
I might as well die.

39:43.839 --> 39:45.240
Try them on before you die.

39:46.200 --> 39:47.479
Ruoruo, you are always a good girl.

39:47.479 --> 39:48.280
Please let me go.

39:48.280 --> 39:49.939
Xian, I truly feel bad for you.

39:49.959 --> 39:51.439
But you are smiling.

39:51.919 --> 39:52.999
Am I?

39:53.120 --> 39:55.039
I haven't had breakfast yet.
I feel unwell.

39:55.439 --> 39:57.240
Eat while you try them on.

39:59.999 --> 40:01.120
I need to tinkle.

40:14.039 --> 40:15.200
Your wedding is in two days.

40:15.200 --> 40:16.459
Where are you going?

40:16.479 --> 40:17.999
Unless you don't want to get married,

40:17.999 --> 40:19.519
run off as you like.

40:23.560 --> 40:26.879
That is a great torture for him.

40:26.959 --> 40:28.439
How did you know?

40:29.600 --> 40:31.160
Because I know him well.

40:34.280 --> 40:36.359
If he doesn't run away now,

40:36.800 --> 40:38.999
it means he really cares about me.

40:49.959 --> 40:51.120
Gave up already?

40:54.439 --> 40:55.519
Bring it on.

41:42.399 --> 41:45.060
Young Lady, there are
more gowns to try on.

41:45.080 --> 41:47.240
Please hold on.

41:47.600 --> 41:49.760
I won't run away if he doesn't.

41:51.160 --> 41:52.240
Wan'er.

41:52.959 --> 41:53.859
Wan'er.

41:53.879 --> 41:54.959
Ling'er.

41:55.720 --> 41:56.780
You came just in time.

41:56.800 --> 41:57.959
I have tried so many gowns on,

41:57.959 --> 41:59.060
but I can't decide.

41:59.080 --> 42:00.540
Come on and help me.

42:00.560 --> 42:01.999
There is something urgent.

42:04.999 --> 42:05.879
You may take a rest.

42:05.879 --> 42:07.080
Give us the room.

42:07.999 --> 42:09.240
You may go.

42:17.240 --> 42:18.479
What's the matter?

42:18.640 --> 42:19.720
Li Cheng...

42:21.480 --> 42:22.800
What's wrong with you?

42:22.959 --> 42:23.939
Did you catch a cold?

42:23.959 --> 42:25.039
No.

42:26.080 --> 42:27.100
Tao,

42:27.120 --> 42:29.280
bring me the cold medicine.

42:29.439 --> 42:31.620
Young Lady, where did you put it?

42:31.640 --> 42:32.720
It's at...

42:33.080 --> 42:34.419
Fine, I will get it myself.

42:34.439 --> 42:35.720
Give me a moment.

42:49.439 --> 42:50.519
Who is there?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.156 --> 44:58.626
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
